WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,490
Only you understand the language of birds

2
00:00:01,490 --> 00:00:02,850
Your whole family understands bird language

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,730
I have severed all ties with you.

4
00:00:04,730 --> 00:00:53,500
I've been hanging on my body for a long time
